  "prefLabel": "Nat 501.02 Noncompliance with Standards as Unprofessional Conduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 501.02 Noncompliance with Standards as Unprofessional Conduct. The ethical standards set forth in this part shall bind all licensees, and noncompliance with these standards may result in discipline pursuant to RSA 328-E:14, II. The board shall investigate violations of these standards and impose disciplinary sanctions for such violations by following the disciplinary procedures set forth in Nat 404.\n\nSource. #12113, eff 2-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nat100-700.html"
